    - target: {fileID: 3420934007624536057, guid: c8309454679ed724caa75355a38dee08, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "A copy of the ceasefire agreement that was signed by the political
        leaders (at the time) of each of the 3 groups. It marked the end of the civil
        war, and the dawn of a new era in the country of Streynia. \r\nThe agreement
        detailed that the country would be governed by a representative of each of
        the three groups for a few decades, to fix the damages incurred and to stabilize
        public outrage."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
